,{"author_id":"1676602451569307649","conversation_id":"1782472416477970487","created_at":"2024-04-22T18:11:55.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1782472416477970487"],"id":"1782472416477970487","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":455416,"like_count":39,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":0},"text":"X能不能不要再标记了？你们非说它是敏感内容，这推文敏感不敏感，我们能不知道吗？ https://t.co/oOYh5VGfru","url":"https://x.com/woaierjie/status/1782472416477970487"},{"author_id":"1676602451569307649","conversation_id":"1781305490724798925","created_at":"2024-04-19T12:54:58.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1781305490724798925"],"id":"1781305490724798925","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":9,"impression_count":327463,"like_count":77,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":2},"text":"二姐进我房间也不打招呼，昨天我正幻想着二姐在被子里打飞机的时候,二姐推门进来，差点给我吓软了。之后二姐看到我从房间出来，书都没继续看，冲我眨了眨眼睛，我怀疑她猜到了我在打飞机，不过二姐倒是没有戳破我，我现在也不确定她到底知道不知道。","url":"https://x.com/woaierjie/status/1781305490724798925"},{"author_id":"1676602451569307649","conversation_id":"1780223437505716375","created_at":"2024-04-16T13:15:17.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1780223437505716375"],"id":"1780223437505716375","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":33,"impression_count":508980,"like_count":258,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":13},"text":"说实话我也特别喜欢看二姐的腿,特别喜欢二姐穿丝袜,经常看着看着二姐的腿就硬,好几次都是偷偷的拿二姐的丝袜内裤打飞机,但是每次我都好怕她发现。。。 https://t.co/veRfcVZrRD","url":"https://x.com/woaierjie/status/1780223437505716375"},{"author_id":"1676602451569307649","conversation_id":"1711403229433548863","created_at":"2023-10-09T15:28:20.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1711403229433548863"],"id":"1711403229433548863","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":25,"impression_count":446975,"like_count":171,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":5,"retweet_count":9},"text":"我在高中的时候住在表姐家,我表姐也经常做瑜伽,原本我以为表姐的身材已经天下无敌了,直到今天撞见二姐做瑜伽我才知道什么是完美女人😍看着二姐穿着瑜伽裤完美的线条,若隐若现的\"户型\"翘起的蜜桃臀,口干舌燥,阵阵儿火大,我发誓一定要拿下二姐 #姐姐 #姐弟 https://t.co/Y6PhLYZtbf","url":"https://x.com/woaierjie/status/1711403229433548863"},{"author_id":"1676602451569307649","conversation_id":"1710695902363648255","created_at":"2023-10-07T16:37:40.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1710695902363648255"],"id":"1710695902363648255","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":55,"impression_count":328765,"like_count":248,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":9,"retweet_count":9},"text":"开学有一小段时间了,还不是很适应,和高中时候完全不一样,同学之间也不像高中时那么亲密！好在我经常回二姐家住,和室友之间相处的还是很愉快,他们很羡慕我可以回家,如果他们三个叼毛知道我不但可以回家住,家里更有如花似玉的二姐,怕是要羡慕死我,如果知道我每天都对二姐。。。 https://t.co/fIjqZQJn5O","url":"https://x.com/woaierjie/status/1710695902363648255"}],"includes":{"users":[{"id":"1676602451569307649","name":"住在二姐家","profile_image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1710272374078324736/tmwJ8KPy_normal.jpg","username":"woaierjie","verified":false}]},"meta":{"newest_id":"1790363237407654076","oldest_id":"1710695902363648255","previous_token":"77qpymm88g5h9vqkluxfc5j69g0adklm4fvsd860iddfa","result_count":9}}